    "builderDescription": "One Group began its journey in 2002 starting with the construction of Independent Floors in South Delhi. The Chairman of One Group, Mr. Sunil Kumar Jain, has a vision of providing mass housing and commercial spaces to his clientele. Therefore, by 2006, One Group shifted focus to malls, townships and group farmhouses. We, at One Group, focus on providing high quality units to the esteemed customers within a pre-defined timeline. Thanks to the immaculate planning and foresight, we have always provided the possession of our projects within the projected delivery period. To stick to our project deadlines, One Group has remained a Debt-free organisation. Being debt-free allows us to steer away from financial constraints which delays real estate projects. Today, we also have an experienced and highly skilled team of professionals required for complete execution of real estate projects. Thanks to the faith shown in us by our customers, One Group today has presence in 5 states and is a well known name in the world of Real Estate.\r\n",
