    "description": "Signature Global Park I Ext is a thoughtfully designed residential community by Signature Global, offering premium low-rise homes that blend modern comfort with a serene lifestyle. Featuring contemporary architecture, spacious layouts, and landscaped open spaces, the project creates a vibrant environment for families. With lifestyle amenities, excellent connectivity, and proximity to key commercial and social hubs, Signature Global Park I Ext delivers a balanced living experience in one of Gurgaon’s emerging residential destinations.",
